  "description": "Use can and want with familiar verbs and travel vocabulary.",
  "grammar_note": "Potere means “can”: posso (I can), puoi (you can). Volere means “to want”: voglio (I want), vuoi (you want). Follow either verb with an infinitive: posso parlare (I can speak), voglio viaggiare (I want to travel).",
  "vocabulary": [
